<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>404 — Page introuvable</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            background: #0f2744;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            color: white;
        }
        .container { text-align: center; }
        .code {
            font-size: 120px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #f97316;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        p {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        a {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #f97316;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        a:hover { background: #ea6c0a; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="code">404</div>
    <h1>Page introuvable</h1>
    <p>La page que vous cherchez n'existe pas.</p>
    <a href="/admin/login">Retour à l'accueil</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
